/*
  Synthwave theme - an 80s neon sunset over a glowing grid, palm trees and
  wireframe mountains (res/images/synthwave.jpg, dimmed to sit behind the
  panels). Hot pink frames and buttons, cyan for money coming in, orange
  totals, and darker panels so the text stays easy to read.

  The layout is res/flapxcoin.qss, below its variables; the base colours come
  from the theme table in guiutil.cpp.
*/

